{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10018_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:549761e1162bb51a83002b48d5f36dd131df806ec9cd64fa51a0ca0fbaf72fc2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc1f2936d60b050fa5c5aa78cd6e39013b200c1fb343cec2c256c49cd43898b1",
      "text": "哈！难道说涟亲也\n很Respect猫亲吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36cfc74b8d0ccfdce7e45fcc433267af278c3ee8b1ba8eceacd0ce442c2be774",
      "text": "从刚才开始就叽叽喳喳吵个没完。\n啊啊？是想被我把眼镜打碎吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ed7669937189f9ac37b9d575d130899dc846aceae8245113a716ef38e99c830",
      "text": "（和涟亲聊上的话不是比平时还要多吗？\n要是平时，早就走没影了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8027fee5a342a1c03428a3145705b7f1a2ff72eeb620867a4773930db3480d18",
      "text": "（这全多亏了猫亲啊！既然如此！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:420edc00840685adf15aa427769016b3b0fc16c698ef0a7907dea479a7db16e7",
      "text": "那个……对了。\n你喜欢猫亲吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c1527d9cd4854c22b9007602d5bfb03ac95d853280c31364fbe98e341a0a84",
      "text": "烦死人了……\n话说，别用那种奇怪的称呼叫它。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93be54f4f83e108d3f3b27b080bbacfa2b1c202dbf6788e740831f8dfcb2001d",
      "text": "诶诶诶！？一点都不奇怪啦！你试着叫我一声\n四季亲就能懂了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0854ad8ab0ddea2ab9a0b09235280d7ecd748573f60e2ba6fcf2899b12514078",
      "text": "谁要叫你啊，大～笨蛋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7448100e95d1387467a428199228cd4b058b2773cceff6fe7c4633014aefad3a",
      "text": "明白啦。\n等我们感情变得更好了你再叫我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0f299d0926879c2c9b3fe0402f2e450f58ee2cc6a2910a6a058af5b099bbaa",
      "text": "喵～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a4cd4a1bdaec0031f0f811486eb5450ccdebcddc2d6954222ded1b334d25c90",
      "text": "这只猫亲，超级黏涟亲呢。\n好可爱～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2051b87e3b3c9acc3c41ecc7dd4997d5216169939c8f7b86bfdd49868361d7a3",
      "text": "……切。从刚才起就一口一个猫亲的吵死了。\n这家伙叫霸王。你小子别随便给它起名字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1fc02f6dd5db19d13ea5844ae5b94f8cfab7d4291e1e9cc357e448cdb20ec2",
      "text": "原来是霸王亲啊！听起来好强力的名字啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca31576d61c0603dc288ad5112ace0c2309fa8feb00c35403f6b51c6a9399b1e",
      "text": "那是当然。\n这可是本大爷亲自给它起的名字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bc4c68c964cfd4ddcfe7b054a864061ecd197bd1609e19848f7b3cfd7f0c87e",
      "text": "这么说来，是涟亲在照顾的猫亲啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6ab7ad91a3d8cdfb86fd3e3c8ddd7804b80ee7cbe96ac38dfb8ce7b561a3b8",
      "text": "唔……偶尔喂喂它罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1edbca6077450336a48c47fa71de2476b16e44aafe3dda7fad96ac75fccf6cac",
      "text": "也就是说！涟亲也是Respect猫亲的同伴了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66856d88f0c55b709f830b4990b697c026645b609bcc90bdd9e3168df6147977",
      "text": "哈啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10018_01:1_3_10018_01_g:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6798905d7ab1ef836e16a16fab07f5244974c8be51b38576dd9880e465081871",
      "text": "（嘿嘿，感觉能和涟亲成为好朋友了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
